@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088
@adminUser = admin
@adminPassword = password

### Reset scenario state
POST {{baseUrl}}/__admin/scenarios/reset
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Setup: accept the webhook once
POST {{baseUrl}}/lab/api/payments/pay-001/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_type": "payment.succeeded",
  "event_id": "evt-001"
}

### Mapping 02: duplicate webhook is rejected
POST {{baseUrl}}/lab/api/payments/pay-001/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_type": "payment.succeeded",
  "event_id": "evt-001"
}
